[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727536180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2727536180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2727536180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ikuY0","user":{"login":"francoisdlt","id":935800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzNTgwMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/935800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt","html_url":"https://github.com/francoisdlt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/francoisdlt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T16:44:25Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T16:44:43Z","body":"I've had issues with background loading scenes that had nested and cross dependencies in full GDscript projects as well, so it might not even be related to .NET\nAs a workaround you can add a little delay between the LoadThreadedRequest() calls. \nSomething like this seems to work (i'm not a C# user so forgive me if there are some monstrosities below ^^) : \n\n```cs\npublic override void _Ready()\n\t{\n\t\tload();\n\t}\n\npublic async void load()\n{\n\tvar files = DirAccess.GetFilesAt(\"res://\");\n\tforeach (var file in files)\n\t{\n\t\tif (file.GetExtension() != \"tscn\") continue;\n\t\tif (!ResourceLoader.Exists(file)) continue;\n\t\tGD.Print(\"Loading \" + file);\n\t\tResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(file);\n\t\tawait ToSignal(GetTree().CreateTimer(0.1), \"timeout\");\n\t\t_pending.Add(file);\n\t}\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727536180/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727575181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2727575181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2727575181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ik36N","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-16T18:15:30Z","updated_at":"2025-03-16T18:15:30Z","body":"It seems we already have a few duplicates of this issue:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103674\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99128\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727575181/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727740953","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2727740953","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2727740953,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ilgYZ","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T00:17:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T00:17:16Z","body":"Not hanging for me with:\n\n```\n        var files = DirAccess.GetFilesAt(\"res://\");\n        Parallel.ForEach(files, f =>\n        {\n            if (f.GetExtension() == \"tscn\")\n            {\n                GD.Print($\"Loading {f}\");\n                ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(f, string.Empty, true);\n                GD.Print($\"Loaded {f}\");\n            }\n        });\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2727740953/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728352952","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2728352952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2728352952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6in1y4","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T06:36:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T06:36:52Z","body":"> Not hanging for me with : `/* code */`\n\nNo, that's not how `ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest` works. The API you call merely starts the loading process; in other words, the resources are not finished loading after the method call.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728352952/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729325266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2729325266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2729325266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6irjLS","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T12:32:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T12:32:59Z","body":"> > Not hanging for me with : `/* code */`\n> \n> No, that's not how `ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest` works. The API you call merely starts the loading process; in other words, the resources are not finished loading after the method call.\n\nThe prints were not the point. Why are you focusing on the GD.Prints? It's just not hanging. No hang in the editor, no hang in the project. It continues to function fine after this code. And makes it to an eventual GetTree().Quit() cleanly, without any error messages of any kind.\n\nThe GD.Prints are irrelevant and were only there for my convenience while experimenting with this problem.\n\nThe key focus here is the Parallel.ForEach. As a viable workaround for the hang.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729325266/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729623294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2729623294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2729623294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6isr7-","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T13:59:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T13:59:50Z","body":"> The key focus here is the Parallel.ForEach. As a viable workaround for the hang.\n\nYour example is correct by itself, but it's just irrelevant to the issue topic.\n\n>  No hang in the editor, no hang in the project. It continues to function fine after this code.\n\nUnder this context `ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest` itself of couse does not hang, because it only starts the loading process, there is no issue about it.\nI don't even need your `Parallel.ForEach`. If I just need to iterate through the files, I can use a `foreach` loop.\n\n```csharp\nvar files = DirAccess.GetFilesAt(\"res://\");\nforeach (var f in files)\n{\n    if (f.GetExtension() != \"tscn\") continue;\n    ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(f, string.Empty, true);\n}\n```\n\nThe real problem is when I actually need the loaded resources. These loading subroutines never finish for some of them. If you actually open the MRP and try it out, I'm sure it will help you understand the issue more.\n\nIf you have trouble downloading my MRP, I have replaced my initial start code with your `Parallel.ForEach` trick and recorded this video. See the resources won't load anyway either.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6db9f4c0-e15c-4afd-8a8d-ea04b56dd7b2","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729623294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730715520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-2730715520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":2730715520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iw2mA","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T20:06:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T20:06:55Z","body":"> The real problem is when I actually need the loaded resources. These loading subroutines never finish for some of them. If you actually open the MRP and try it out, I'm sure it will help you understand the issue more.\n\nI understood the issue just fine. You were simply misunderstanding what I was trying to demonstrate. That it worked fine for me. Without hanging. As in, I've even went so far as to implement this very approach in my own project. Without it hanging. And with it _actually_ **allowing** me to access the requested resources. Without any issue of any kind.\n\nUntil... I exported the build.\n\nIn debug/editor, it was fine for me. Release build... did indeed hang.\n\nSo, yes, there is an issue. And, yes, there is a partial workaround. What I find clearly indicates there is some sort of race condition going on here. With the optimizations for Release builds, the hang as a result of this race occurred for me. Without those optimizations, it did not.\n\nAnd, I'd appreciate not being talked down to like I do not understand the issue at hand. Might want to pick up a mirror before doing so.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730715520/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3254159307","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104196#issuecomment-3254159307","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104196","id":3254159307,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7B9ofL","user":{"login":"OeilDeLance","id":3606403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDY0MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3606403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance","html_url":"https://github.com/OeilDeLance","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OeilDeLance/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-04T15:06:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-04T15:38:16Z","body":"I've had the same issue on a rather big project I am working on in my company. \nIt happens both at runtime and at editor time.\nI've also made an mrp, here it is:\nhttps://drive.proton.me/urls/X7EPN88QVW#2Vx76hTjdSCw\n\nYou will see that the load process get's stuck at 50% for between 3 to 5 files depending on the machine.\nSo that's about  2% of the 160+ load requests.\n\nThis is a serious bug and basically prevents us from shipping while using LoadThreadedRequest.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3254159307/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url"